; Changed for Xpeccy+ on 2026-11-13: data ranges from his DEFB and DEFS (db), DEFW
; (da) and DEFM (text) lines; a message's last character (DEFB 'x'+$80) and the (c)
; sign before one ($7F) as part of its text.
;
; Converted to the Debugger's text format on 2026-11-20 (docs/debugger-format.md):
; rom NAME <MD5 of a 16K bank> [skip what that bank has not], the bundled images
; above it; NAME:ADDR LABEL a name; db/dw/da/dm/dc NAME:ADDR LENGTH data, N*K for
; K statements of N.
; 128-0.rom, zxevo-fe.rom bank 6
rom BASIC128 b4d2692115a9f2924df92a3cbfb358fb
; 128p-0.rom, atm2.rom bank 2, profi-bios10.rom bank 2, profi-bios20.rom bank 2, profi-kramis02.rom bank 2, tsconf.rom bank 2, zxevo-fe.rom bank 10, zxevo-fe.rom bank 30
